<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center" class="tborder" style="border-bottom: 0;">
	<tr class="titlebg">
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="15%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/topic/normal_post.gif" alt="" />
			Author
		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: Ranger Guide 001 &nbsp;(Read 269 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=266" title="View the profile of Bowslinger">Bowslinger</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 53<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=266"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=485.msg3403#msg3403"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=485.msg3403#msg3403">Ranger Guide 001</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> November 29, 2003, 03:42:44 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							If you lack the ability to hit the delete button and you just have to play a Ranger then I pitty you. But since your stupid and it can&#039;t be helped, here are some do&#039;s and dont&#039;s.<br /><br />NEVER EVER volunteer for anything. You don&#039;t pull, You don&#039;t tank, You don&#039;t heal, You don&#039;t add tank, and never ever ever are you too peal or obtain agro in anyway shape or form.<br /><br />When looking for a group say you are a Warrior and dawn your Tolens gear so you look all plate like. When the Cleric complanes you have shit for HP&#039;s just say your a twink. They won&#039;t drop you because they need a tank and even a bad Warrior is better than any Ranger LFG.<br /><br />When asked whats on tracking say nothing. When ask if blah blah is up, say no then &nbsp;type /who ascent all and send one of them a tell that blah blah is up. In return ask for a guild invite. Rince and Repeat untill you get the invite.<br /><br />If your guild ask&#039;s you to go check on some mob, tell them your logging in a few and type /anon and turn guildchat off. Proceed grinding/questing ect... Turn guildchat back on in 30 minutes and see if they have found anything so you can go get loot and some dkp. This is best expidited by asking for a port in guildchat. Repeat untill you get at least 3 tells for ports.<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br />Hmm, your still here ?<br />What about being a sucky Ranger don&#039;t you understand? Now go away and make a Warrior.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: November 30, 2003, 07:20:30 am by Bowslinger</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg3404"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=266" title="View the profile of Bowslinger">Bowslinger</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 53<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=266"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=485.msg3404#msg3404"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=485.msg3404#msg3404">Re:Ranger Guide 001</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> November 30, 2003, 06:56:34 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Ok so your stupid and you just have to be a Ranger.<br />There are 3 main things you will need too perfect.<br /><br />1. How to obtain agro<br />2. How to loose agro<br />3. What harmony will and will not do<br /><br />Once you have mastered these 3, your pretty much on your own as far as when to use which and when not too. Obviously your expected to know &quot;at all times&quot; what is up, what is due to be up and when what was killed last. And &nbsp;be where you need to be, to check on what is due and who is there waiting for it. Your information relayed to the officers if your not one is what will move or not move your guild. Information is your only value so use it and have it even if they don&#039;t want it.<br /><br />This will do two things to your Ranger.<br />1. Folks will hate you alot<br />2. Folks will hate you even more<br /><br />The ones that hate you will be the officers of the other guilds. As your name will be mentioned when &quot;their&quot; tracker is in the zone along with your guild name, thus the Hate.<br /><br />The other ones will be your guildmates and the other trackers in the zone. Be nice to other trackers and you may get info &quot;actually reliable&quot; that will save you time when hunting down mobs to kill. You will learn there names better than some of your own guildmates, and may need one of them to save your ass with a peal on occasion. You will find some bond between pullers and rangers in this regard, but it&#039;s only out of necessity that you even talk to other guild scum anyway. P.S. don&#039;t trust anyone ie: &quot;Sorry I was AFK &quot; still leaves your ass dead with no rez. ???<br /><br />DEAD WITH NO REZ!?<br />Yes get use to it. You will take more than your share of &quot;I&quot;m dead SSRA and &nbsp;I see two people in the zone&quot;. This is when you make a twink, cause your on downtime. Once some officers log on and some possable support shows up, they come click you when passing by. More likely you will spend the other two hours you had set aside for play time, dragging your own ass to the zone. Getting a rez at zone in is about 998% more likely so get use to dragging folks there, by doing yourself a few times.<br /><br />HOW TO OBTAIN AGRO:<br />I&#039;m told Flamelick kicks ass for hate ratio and is fast cast low mana so it&#039;s sole purpose is to generate mass amounts of agro.<br /><br />Casting it however depends on WHY you are wanting to generate agro. There is only one reason &quot;other than tanking, which I told you don&#039;t do&quot; and that is something is wrong and your Pealing to kite, cause you sure as hell are not pealing to tank. Thus you best be casting SNARE &quot;if allowed&quot; or you better have SOW up.<br /><br />Your DPS is the other way you obtain agro, and most times this is unwanted. You have been given Jolt and Seconday skill/spells to apply in support so you don&#039;t have to always MAX your DPS. You will need to judge how much agro the Tank is making and lower yours acorrdingly. It&#039;s a little tricky, but the more you play with certain folks the more you get use to adjusting ie: Switch to 2hs or a non procing blah blah...<br /><br />UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCE WILL RUNNING AWAY LOWER YOUR AGRO. HOWEVER..<br />Some mobs have adjustments for range, it&#039;s not that noticable most times but it can be very deadly if you don&#039;t PAY ATTENTION to your distance. You are a Ranger, everthing hates you. If you need an example try a frog in Sebiles, don&#039;t even attack, just use Proxy Agro, seems they don&#039;t like things standing on them.<br /><br />Harmony:<br />No way.... go figure it out yourself. It&#039;s not even AE anymore. What can I say, It use to be fun, now it&#039;s a pain. But what they let a skilled user do with it can be very stunning. It&#039;s the ultimate pulling tool, outdoors that is.<br /><br />Bonus Section:<br />Bind Sight:<br />I never heard anyone else talk much about Bind Sight. I use to explore 30% of zones I didn&#039;t get to go too months before I went there. It allowed me to join Raids in Ntov and never leave the Zone in. You want to know how someone pulls on raids or what ever, you just bind sight with anyone coming in with that raid. You want to see the whole zone, use bind sight. You can even Bind Sight with a corpse on one end of the zone from the other side.<br />The trick is obtaining targets, I never could see into the Burrowers Lair in the Deep to confirm it&#039;s upness, try that one if your looking for a waste of time.<br />Try Binding Sight too the Hand of Vasheen in the Plane of Sky,,, thats a nice adventure.<br /><br />Wepons Shield:<br />Used by you mainly to save your own ass. My personal favorite use is to buy me time to use a gate potion. I can&#039;t count the times I got dumped and logged into a full room of mobs later. Remember to have your back against a wall or your screwed and if you trying to gate to an AE mob, goodluck WS does not stop AE or attacks from behind.<br />Group usage varies depending on the circumstance, but mostly you will buying the cleric time to camp out and or get something out of camp so you can die in a safe place, buying even more time.<br />Guilds use is to build agro so the Tank can gain it from you with AE taunt. If you want to live, you must stop attacking and slowly back up after the Tank hits AE taunt. Don&#039;t heal yourself or cast Jolt. After everyone else is told to engage, heal yourself then go in casting Jolt. AND PUT THAT EARTHCALLER AWAY!<br /><br />Use these tools wisley and the rest takes care of itself. Remember it&#039;s your own fault you died and if it&#039;s not worth dying for, then wtf.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: December 01, 2003, 02:20:23 am by Bowslinger</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg3405"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=179" title="View the profile of Kelce">Kelce</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 106<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/megatron.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Asshole.<br />
								<br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/kelce@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="kelce@hotmail.com" border="0" /></a>
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=179"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.menacingvisage.com" title="Linkz" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:kelce@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=485.msg3405#msg3405"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=485.msg3405#msg3405">Re:Ranger Guide 001</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> November 30, 2003, 04:35:59 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCE WILL RUNNING AWAY LOWER YOUR AGRO.</div><br />Fucking priceless, Bow.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
